{"seq":2,"slug":"eagle-feature","title":"EAGLE 特征级推测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/advanced/eagle-feature","wordCount":1380,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"eagle-特征级推测\">EAGLE 特征级推测</h1><p>Medusa 的几个头各自盯着同一个末层向量「各猜各的」，靠后位置越猜越虚。EAGLE（Extrapolation Algorithm for Greater Language-model Efficiency，2024）从一个更锋利的观察重做了草稿：与其在 <strong>token 层</strong>预测「下一个 token 是什么」，不如在<strong>特征层</strong>预测「下一个 token 的隐藏状态会是什么」。隐藏状态是连续、信息丰富的，比离散 token 更可预测；草稿头在特征空间里自回归地往前推，再用主模型自己的 LM 头把推出的特征翻译成 token。这一个视角的转换，把推测解码的接受率推到了新高度，使 EAGLE-3 成为 2026 年生产部署的事实标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-在特征空间里做自回归草稿\">核心概念：在特征空间里做自回归草稿</h2><p>EAGLE 的草稿头不直接吐 token，而是预测下一个位置的<strong>特征向量</strong>（hidden state）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，然后复用主模型已有的 LM 头 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>lm</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{lm}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把它映射成 token 分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>DraftHead</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>lm</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{t+1} = \\text{DraftHead}\\big(f_t,\\, e_{t}\\big),\\qquad \\hat{p}_{t+1} = \\text{softmax}\\big(W_{\\text{lm}} \\cdot f_{t+1}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DraftHead</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上一步 token 的嵌入。关键差别在于草稿头是<strong>自回归</strong>的：它把自己上一步预测的特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 喂回来预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置「知道」前面位置猜了什么——这正是 <a href=\"medusa-heads\">Medusa 多头</a> 各头互不通信所欠缺的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;主模型: 前缀的特征序列 f&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;EAGLE 草稿头&lt;br/&gt;在特征空间自回归&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;预测 f_t+1&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;复用主模型 LM 头&lt;br/&gt;f -&gt; token 分布&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;f_t+1 喂回草稿头&lt;br/&gt;预测 f_t+2&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;草稿 token 序列&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;主模型一次前向验证&lt;br/&gt;无损接受&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"主模型: 前缀的特征序列 f\"] --&gt; B[\"EAGLE 草稿头&lt;br/&gt;在特征空间自回归\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"预测 f_t+1\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"复用主模型 LM 头&lt;br/&gt;f -&gt; token 分布\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"f_t+1 喂回草稿头&lt;br/&gt;预测 f_t+2\"]\n  E --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; F[\"草稿 token 序列\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"主模型一次前向验证&lt;br/&gt;无损接受\"]</pre><p>为什么特征级更好预测？因为 token 是对连续语义的「硬量化」，丢了大量信息；而隐藏状态保留了完整的连续语义，相邻位置的特征轨迹更平滑、更可外推。在特征空间做自回归，等于在一个信息没被截断的空间里推演。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三代演进-从单层特征到融合三层-动态树\">三代演进：从单层特征到融合三层 + 动态树</h2><p>EAGLE 经过三代，每一代解决一个具体瓶颈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>核心改进</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>相对增益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EAGLE-1</td>\n<td>特征级自回归草稿</td>\n<td>Medusa 头间不通信、token 层信息损失</td>\n<td>显著高于 Medusa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EAGLE-2</td>\n<td>动态草稿树（expand + rerank 两阶段）</td>\n<td>固定树结构不适配上下文</td>\n<td>在 EAGLE-1 上再提速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EAGLE-3</td>\n<td>融合早/中/晚三层特征 + 训练时测试</td>\n<td>单层特征表征不够、训练-推理不一致</td>\n<td>batch=1 时比 EAGLE-2 快约 1.4x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>EAGLE-2 的动态树是把草稿组织成树并按节点的联合概率两阶段构造（先 expand 扩树、再 rerank 剪枝），这套机制详见 <a href=\"tree-attention-verify\">树注意力与多候选验证</a>。</p>\n<p>EAGLE-3 是当前标杆，它的关键改进是<strong>特征融合</strong>——不再只用主模型某一层的特征，而是同时融合三个深度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;主模型 N 层&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;早层特征&lt;br/&gt;句法 形态 局部 token 上下文&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;中层特征&lt;br/&gt;语义关系 篇章结构&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;晚层特征&lt;br/&gt;直接的输出分布&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;EAGLE-3 草稿头&lt;br/&gt;融合三层特征&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;更准的特征级自回归草稿&lt;br/&gt;接受率更高&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"主模型 N 层\"] --&gt; B[\"早层特征&lt;br/&gt;句法 形态 局部 token 上下文\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"中层特征&lt;br/&gt;语义关系 篇章结构\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"晚层特征&lt;br/&gt;直接的输出分布\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"EAGLE-3 草稿头&lt;br/&gt;融合三层特征\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"更准的特征级自回归草稿&lt;br/&gt;接受率更高\"]</pre><p>早层管句法、中层管语义、晚层管输出分布，三者融合让草稿头的表征远比 Medusa 的「只看末层」丰富。EAGLE-3 还用了约 8 倍于 EAGLE 的数据训练，并引入「训练时测试」（training-time test）来对齐训练与推理时草稿头实际面对的输入分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的性能与生态地位\">2026 年的性能与生态地位</h2><p>公开基准（2026 年）给出的数字：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EAGLE-3 在 H100 上比 EAGLE-2 与 Medusa-2 在每秒 token 数上高 15% 到 25%。</li>\n<li>在 H200 上，相比标准 vLLM，EAGLE-3 把每美元 token 数提升 3 到 4 倍，且输出质量零损失（无损推测，见 <a href=\"../foundations/lossless-guarantee\">分布无损性保证</a>）。</li>\n<li>接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 在真实负载下大致落在 0.6 到 0.8（理论分析里常用的接近 1 的值不现实）。</li>\n<li>EAGLE-3 的接受率只取决于模型架构、不随 GPU 代际变化——换硬件不用重调。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>生态上，EAGLE-3 已于 2026 年初合入 vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM 主干，成为「上推测解码」的默认选项。前沿仍在快速演进：2026 年 3 月 vLLM 提出的 P-EAGLE 去掉了 EAGLE-3 草稿阶段的串行瓶颈，在 NVIDIA B200 上相对原版 EAGLE-3 再快至多 1.69 倍。这些数字对应的工程权衡——接受率如何换算成实际加速、batch 上来后会怎样——分别见 <a href=\"../practice/acceptance-rate-tuning\">接受率与加速比</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/serving-batching-spec\">批服务下的推测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其他草稿源的关系\">与其他草稿源的关系</h2><p>EAGLE 属于「事后给已训好模型加草稿头」的路线，与 <a href=\"medusa-heads\">Medusa 多头</a> 同类但全面更优；它与预训练联合的 <a href=\"../draft-models/self-speculative\">MTP</a> 在「用主模型自身信息当草稿」上理念相近，但 EAGLE 的草稿头是外挂的轻量自回归网络、可对任意现成模型训练，而 MTP 必须在预训练阶段就植入。对显存或训练管线极受限、或输出高度复制输入的场景，仍可能选 <a href=\"../draft-models/ngram-retrieval-draft\">n-gram 与检索草稿</a> 这类零成本方案；但对追求最高通用接受率的生产部署，EAGLE-3 是 2026 年的默认答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EAGLE 在<strong>特征空间</strong>而非 token 空间做自回归草稿：预测下一位置的隐藏状态，再用主模型 LM 头翻成 token；特征连续、信息全，比离散 token 更可外推。</li>\n<li>草稿头自回归地把上一步特征喂回，使各位置互相「知情」，根治了 Medusa 头间不通信的短板。</li>\n<li>三代演进：EAGLE-1 特征级自回归、EAGLE-2 动态草稿树、EAGLE-3 融合早/中/晚三层特征 + 训练时测试；EAGLE-3 是 2026 年生产标杆。</li>\n<li>公开基准：H100 上比 Medusa-2 快 15–25%，H200 上每美元 token 数提升 3–4 倍且无损，真实接受率约 0.6–0.8；已合入 vLLM/SGLang/TensorRT-LLM，P-EAGLE 在 B200 上再提速至多 1.69x。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：被它超越的前代见 <a href=\"medusa-heads\">Medusa 多头</a>，它依赖的树验证机制见 <a href=\"tree-attention-verify\">树注意力与多候选验证</a>；接受率到加速比的换算见 <a href=\"../practice/acceptance-rate-tuning\">接受率与加速比</a>。跨库可参考 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/vllm-and-frameworks\">LLM 服务推理系统 · vLLM 与框架</a> 看 EAGLE 在服务框架里的落地。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EAGLE 特征级推测","id":"eagle-特征级推测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：在特征空间里做自回归草稿","id":"核心概念-在特征空间里做自回归草稿"},{"level":2,"text":"三代演进：从单层特征到融合三层 + 动态树","id":"三代演进-从单层特征到融合三层-动态树"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的性能与生态地位","id":"2026-年的性能与生态地位"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他草稿源的关系","id":"与其他草稿源的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Medusa 多头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/advanced/medusa-heads"},"next":{"title":"树注意力与多候选验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/advanced/tree-attention-verify"}}